                                                "sense_id": "3be0d0cd-e295-3c8e-94ea-8cf9ab6448bf",
                                                "text": "I’m not what you call an “A” student but I don’t mind school at lease it takes me away from home but the teachers are too prejudice they are mostly Whites and I never got a fair mark out of them."
