                                                "sense_id": "dbb6430d-2805-332c-a016-810c2588b193",
                                                "text": "Living in Germany, I see it as my human responsibility to call it out for its one-sidedness, its hypocrisy and its acquiesence in the ethnic cleansing of Gaza."
